+/// Structured advice attached to a capacity response.  The semantic
+/// `ServerOverloaded` error remains payload-free so existing category and
+/// retryability consumers do not have to pattern-match wire diagnostics.
+#[derive(Clone, Debug, Default, Deserialize, Eq, PartialEq, Serialize)]
